{"title":"감전","artist":"요네즈 켄시","sourceId":"reference:3oZGWFc3W6V8mxBoMCXw","sourceHash":"4a2be5b59a7badbf4d591b8eeb77e648f8516f9e690feb3f7f31be14172fc365","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":34910841,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":20.07,"end":24.85,"text":"逃げ出したい夜の往来 行方は未だ不明","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":24.85,"end":29.14,"text":"回り回って虚しくって 困っちゃったワンワンワン","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":29.14,"end":34.11,"text":"失ったつもりもないが 何か足りない気分","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":34.11,"end":39.65,"text":"ちょっと変にハイになって 吹かし込んだ四輪車","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":39.65,"end":42.0,"text":"兄弟よ如何かしよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":42.0,"end":44.38,"text":"もう何も考えない様","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":44.38,"end":48.96,"text":"銀河系の外れへと さようなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":48.96,"end":51.08,"text":"真実も 道徳も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":51.08,"end":53.74,"text":"動作しないイカれた夜でも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":53.74,"end":57.68,"text":"僕ら手を叩いて笑い合う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":57.68,"end":64.42,"text":"誰にも知られないまま","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":64.42,"end":69.15,"text":"たった一瞬の このきらめきを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":69.15,"end":73.86,"text":"食べ尽くそう二人で くたばるまで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":73.86,"end":78.42,"text":"そして幸運を 僕らに祈りを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":78.42,"end":83.95,"text":"まだ行こう 誰も追いつけないくらいのスピードで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":83.95,"end":88.05,"text":"稲妻の様に生きていたいだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":88.05,"end":90.33,"text":"お前はどうしたい？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":90.33,"end":93.89,"text":"返事はいらない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":101.68,"end":106.44,"text":"転がした車窓と情景 動機は未だ不明","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":106.44,"end":111.09,"text":"邪魔臭くて苛ついて 迷い込んだニャンニャンニャン","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":111.09,"end":115.62,"text":"ここいらで落とした財布 誰か見ませんでした？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":115.62,"end":121.14,"text":"馬鹿みたいについてないね 茶化してくれハイウェイ・スター","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":121.14,"end":123.58,"text":"よう相棒 もう一丁","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":123.58,"end":125.85,"text":"漫画みたいな喧嘩しようよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":125.85,"end":130.43,"text":"酒落になんないくらいのやつを お試しで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":130.43,"end":132.44,"text":"正論と 暴論の","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":132.44,"end":135.28,"text":"分類さえ出来やしない街を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":135.28,"end":139.35,"text":"抜け出して互いに笑い合う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":139.35,"end":146.05,"text":"目指すのは メロウなエンディング","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":146.05,"end":150.78,"text":"それは心臓を 刹那に揺らすもの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":150.78,"end":155.22,"text":"追いかけた途端に 見失っちゃうの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":155.22,"end":159.81,"text":"きっと永遠が どっかにあるんだと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":159.81,"end":165.51,"text":"明後日を 探し回るのも 悪くはないでしょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":165.51,"end":169.54,"text":"お前がどっかに消えた朝より","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":169.54,"end":171.86,"text":"こんな夜の方が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":171.86,"end":174.52,"text":"まだましさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":174.52,"end":178.72,"text":"肺に睡蓮 遠くのサイレン","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":178.72,"end":183.73,"text":"響き合う境界線","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},